From 4c27922080702f0c6b305e9222b5c98d8d865d0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Worldstream Development <development@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:50:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Keep fleet machine inventory reads from creating local state

Classify missing private directories separately from invalid or inaccessible state. Read only the existing operator, seed and roster on inventory queries and retain the enrollment write path.

Co-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>

